# Mirrors .gitignore for npm pack. With package.json "files" set, npm applies
# this file (not .gitignore) inside the listed directories, so the ledger
# database and run artifacts must be repeated here (docs/security.md).
.cortex/
**/.cortex/
orgs/
**/events.jsonl
**/reasoning.md
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
node_modules/
test/
scripts/
docs/
.claude/
.github/
community/
*.tgz
